WEBVTT

00:08:28.171 --> 00:08:30.467
Finally, and if I can only do one,

00:08:30.491 --> 00:08:32.274
the pros call this the siren.

00:08:32.298 --> 00:08:34.918
It's really good. It starts
with "we" and goes to "aw."

00:08:34.942 --> 00:08:36.562
The "we" is high, the "aw" is low.

00:08:36.586 --> 00:08:42.682
So you go, weeeaawww, weeeaawww.

00:08:42.706 --> 00:08:44.945
Fantastic. Give yourselves
a round of applause.

00:08:44.969 --> 00:08:46.214
Take a seat, thank you.

00:08:46.238 --> 00:08:47.688
(Applause)

00:08:47.712 --> 00:08:50.312
Next time you speak, do those in advance.

00:08:50.336 --> 00:08:52.952
Now let me just put this
in context to close.

00:08:52.976 --> 00:08:55.248
This is a serious point here.

00:08:55.272 --> 00:08:57.079
This is where we are now, right?

00:08:57.103 --> 00:08:58.744
We speak not very well

00:08:58.768 --> 00:09:00.612
to people who simply aren't listening